### 6.测试 elasticsearch 的分词效果
GET http://192.168.1.100:9200/_analyze
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "analyzer": "ik_max_word",
  "text": "欢迎来到黑马程序员学习"
}


### 7.创建索引
PUT http://192.168.1.100:9200/app_info_article
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "mappings":{
    "properties":{
      "id":{
        "type":"long"
      },
      "publishTime":{
        "type":"date"
      },
      "layout":{
        "type":"integer"
      },
      "images":{
        "type":"keyword",
        "index": false
      },
      "staticUrl":{
        "type":"keyword",
        "index": false
      },
      "authorId": {
        "type": "long"
      },
      "authorName": {
        "type": "text"
      },
      "title":{
        "type":"text",
        "analyzer":"ik_smart"
      },
      "content":{
        "type":"text",
        "analyzer":"ik_smart"
      }
    }
  }
}

### 8.查询索引
GET http://192.168.1.100:9200/app_info_article

### 9.查询文档
http://192.168.1.100:9200/app_info_article/_search

